<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Taro Milk Cafe | A Little Cup of Happiness</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Nikmati taro milk dan minuman manis favoritmu di Taro Milk Cafe.">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --purple: #9270b8;
      --dark: #49345d;
      --pink: #f6dce9;
      --cream: #fffaf3;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      background: rgba(255, 250, 243, 0.96);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 15px #49345d0d;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--purple);
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-left: 22px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    nav a:hover { color: var(--purple); }

    .hero {
      min-height: 570px;
      padding: 75px 8%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8e8f1, #e7dcf7);
    }

    .hero-text { max-width: 550px; }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: var(--purple);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 span { color: var(--purple); }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #705f7d;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--purple);
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: var(--dark);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .hero-image {
      width: min(42%, 420px);
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 48% 48% 25px 25px;
      border: 9px solid #ffffffa8;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px #49345d20;
    }

    section { padding: 80px 8%; }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #887995;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .menu-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .menu-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px #49345d0b;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .menu-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }

    .menu-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .menu-card h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 15px 0 5px;
    }

    .menu-card p {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #887995;
    }

    .price {
      color: var(--purple);
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .about {
      background: #eee5f7;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-content {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: #705f7d;
      line-height: 2;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .contact p {
      color: #887995;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      background: var(--dark);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav { padding: 17px 5%; }
      .logo { font-size: 17px; }
      nav a { margin-left: 10px; font-size: 11px; }
      .hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 55px 6%;
      }
      .hero-image { width: 85%; max-width: 330px; }
      section { padding: 60px 6%; }
      .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .menu-card img { height: 250px; }
      .section-title h2 { font-size: 27px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">☁ Taro Milk Cafe</div>
    <div>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <span class="tag">♡ Sweet, creamy, lovely!</span>
      <h1>A Little Cup of <span>Happiness</span></h1>
      <p>
        Selamat datang di Taro Milk Cafe! Temukan rasa taro
        yang lembut, manis, dan creamy dalam setiap tegukan.
        Dibuat spesial untuk menemani hari terbaikmu.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="#menu">Explore Our Menu ♡</a>
    </div>

    <img class="hero-image"
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541167760496-1628856ab772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85"
      alt="Minuman spesial di Taro Milk Cafe">
  </header>

  <section id="menu">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Our Sweet Menu ♡</h2>
      <p>Made with love, served with happiness.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-grid">
      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541167760496-1628856ab772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="Taro milk">
        <h3>💜 Classic Taro Milk</h3>
        <p>Susu creamy dengan rasa taro yang lembut dan manis.</p>
        <div class="price">Rp18.000</div>
      </article>

      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517701604599-bb29b565090c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="Iced milk drink">
        <h3>🧋 Taro Boba Milk</h3>
        <p>Taro milk favorit dengan topping boba kenyal.</p>
        <div class="price">Rp22.000</div>
      </article>

      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="Sweet cake">
        <h3>🍰 Sweet Berry Cake</h3>
        <p>Kue lembut yang cocok untuk teman minum taro.</p>
        <div class="price">Rp25.000</div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>A Little About Us 💜</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Taro Milk Cafe adalah tempat kecil dengan cinta yang besar
        untuk minuman manis. Kami percaya bahwa secangkir minuman
        yang enak bisa membuat hari terasa lebih indah.
        Datang untuk menikmati rasa, pulang membawa kebahagiaan!
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Visit Us ♡</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Let's Get Something Sweet!</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Punya pertanyaan atau ingin memesan menu favoritmu?</p>
    <a class="btn" id="orderBtn" href="#">Order via WhatsApp ☁</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© <span id="year"></span> Taro Milk Cafe · Made with ♡ and taro</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();

    // Ganti dengan nomor WhatsApp tokomu.
    const nomorWhatsApp = "6281234567890";
    const pesan = "Halo Taro Milk Cafe! Saya ingin memesan menu.";

    document.getElementById("orderBtn").href =
      "https://wa.me/" + nomorWhatsApp +
      "?text=" + encodeURIComponent(pesan);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
